    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esekieli geayaat Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba diktam ea muut bea giibaleakteanya, nea giing'eeta gweayda gil, eaweedeaba damanamughuush bea sheeda, bea gweaydeaba damanang'wan, iing'ata giing'ooyda mujiini, eaweecheanji ghaanyaschi uurda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gweanean hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak damanda duu dandeewa jeeda gidahiimnaan ASEETA, hean gweanean ea ghwaahiinaan jeeda ng'eanyiida Israeli. Ak ghwayiinan uhuuda giijeeda geaw muuchi, nea wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara abeeda gwanda giduurji mujiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama iinea gweanean hoowa, ng'ula, gwanda siida, ama sidaah deaktaanyi ea oomu, ak gwandeawa gulbeeda aba geatindaanyi ea muudayeanda siiteeniida ak ghamiinaada aba gidaghuuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeeshiinean siidida, “Ea orjeeda siida, ng'ula aba gheanyangaagu, iinya aba iidigaagu, ak giyiini jeeda gurooroadaang'u gea jea daahiimneey sean. Aba gideaba geeyeaneey hiji aba gideaba daahiimneey suh rukwiida iita gea jea daaha aba heeda fuga Israeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dooshta mida heeda ghayeawa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda gwanda ghamarda neaweesa meadajeega sean bea gheeda sibata ASEETA. Ak geatindeaba siidida gwanda muudayeanda siiteeniida geawundaanyi geatin lah gil aba gilinyoo ea geatinda, ak goodeen hawundeaba gheedida muudayeanjagi gil, ak geawundaanyi ea muudayeanjagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa ea ghwahita dooshta duukusa meatkweeda ghayeawa, ak gwading'da gidingeayoojigaaschi, ak goodeen gidingeanda dooshta, hawundaanyi muudayeanjagi gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak jeesinga ghoorajeega hawundaanyi ea muudeanjagi gil, ak geawundaanyi ea muudeanjagi gil. Ak dang'adga ghoorajeega geatin muut gil, nea gidingeanda dooshta duukusa doodooda neekeewa dooshta mida meatkweeda gheeda ea muudeanjagi gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goodeen doodooda mida dooshta bea meatkweeda gheeda, ak ea muudeanjagi gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goodeen doodooda mida dooshta, geatin sis ea ghuusigaaschi geatin iyeenya ea doodooda mida dooshta bea meatkweeda gheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoorajeega furiischoodiga, mida dooshta bea meatkweeda ghayeawa ea samwagu meatkweeni ea meatkweeda niirja ea samwagu. Samwagooda nyaawa gwadeenyi ak eara gidaghuudajeega gwadeenyi meatkweeni ea meatkweeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goodeen heeda jaadaat bea dooshta geatin damanamughuush, ak geawunda dooshta ea geatin damwan samwagu gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea madeeda ghoorajeega ea geatinagi gil, meatkweeni ea meatkweeda niirja geatinagi gil. Ak ghoorajeegiga ea geatin lah gil meatkweeni ea meatkweeda niirja ea geatin lah gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goodeen dooshta ghang'eada uhuudeaba ghooriinagi ea ghwahita uhuuda ghooriideaba iyeenya, hawunda jeeda geatin diktam ea muut gil, ghang'eada gidaghuuta ea gagul gidaghuuta niirja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghooriida huuydean muuchi gwaduukusa doodooda. Ak goodeen eara ghooriidida ak hawundaanyi bea jih geatin diktam gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eada madeeda dooshta, ea ghwahita gah heeda doodooda huuydean deaschi dooshta geatinga ea haradam ea damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gwanda seawuutka manang'i aba ghuusiga mida jarooda bea ghoorajeega sean, eara aba ghamarda beashooda ghoorajeega, nea abeeda gwanda ng'oorda miilayga aba gidaghuudajeegeaba gah gal heeda naweeda sik doodooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Doodooda mida jarooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweanean ea ghwaahiinaan doodooda mida jarooda, abeeda gwanda hoowa ghooraji diktam ea damanamughuush neaweesa ghamarda mida jarooda. Nea madeedeaba ghoorajeesu gwanda seamooda sisna lagheanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea seamoodida gwanda murdeeda gidaghuuta ak geawundaanyi gooyang'deay sea geawunda gidaghuuta, nea seamooda mida ng'eanyi gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goodeen barakta jih, ghang'eada madeeda gidaghuuta hiing'aada ea ghwahita madeeda doodooda mida gah, ak ea geatin bughala gil meatkweeda ghayeawa ea wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dooshta mida wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara dooshta mida doodooda jarooda, gal wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa goodeen geawundaanyi ea baraknataanyi bea jih. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ghoorajeagaaschi bea furiischoodiga abeeda gwanda meatkweeni samwagu ak gwanda meatkweeni samwagu, ghuusigaaschi ea doodoonung'weakaaschi gwadeenyi sea dooshtida bea madeedean, geawundaanyi geatin haradam ea damanamughuush gil, ak baraknataanyi bea jih ea diktam ea muut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak seawuutkaaschi ea doodoonung'weakaaschi ea miilaygaaschi giideendaanyi sea giideenda dooshta gal heeda ghayeawa, ak gwadiyeada gidingooji ispwa nea doodoodaanyi gwanda madeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea doodoodida mida gahiin, abeeda gwadeaschi dooshta gal dooshtida bea iyeenyean, mida wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa, ea meatkweeda ghayeawa. Ak goodeen ghang'eada dooshta ea ghwahita dooshta geatin bughala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dooshta mida wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweanean ea ghwaahiinaan wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara, abeeda gwanda dooshta gal wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara, ak goodeen gidaghuudajeagaaschi ea doodoonung'weakaaschi ak gwadeenyi sea suurja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwanda meadajeega sean seawuutka gawuurji ghoorajeega suurja. Geawundaanyi geatin haradam ea damanamughuush gil, nea baraknataanyi bea jih ea diktam ea muut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
