        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gwanda gidingeayooji ispwa jea eeding'deawa nea doodoonung'weakaaschi gwanda madeadaanyi ak gwanda miilayga nuut gwanda meatkweeni nea nuut gwanda meatkweeda niirja. ",
          "type": "text",
