              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwanda dooshta wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara deaschi doodooda mida gah, ak goodeen geatin bughala ghang'eada dooshta ea gagul dooshta nea gagal wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara.",
