        {
          "text": "Hean gweanean ea ghwaahiinaan doodooda mida gah deaschi dooshta wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara, ak goodeen dooshta wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara, ak gwadeenyi sea suurja. ",
