              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoorajeagaaschi bea furiischoodiga ea gidaghuudajeagaaschi, ea doodoonung'weakaaschi gwadeenyi sea suurja, nea meadajeega sean gwaneaweesa seawuutka, ea doodoonung'weakaaschi meadajeega sean. Ak geawundaanyi ea geatin haradam ea damanamughuush gil, ak hawundaanyi bea jih ea geatin diktam ea muut gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
