              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda gwanda meadajeega sean doodoonung'weaka, geawundaanyi geatin diktam ea muut gil, nea hawundaanyi bea jih ea geatin muut gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.30",
