        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoorajeagaaschi bea furiischoodiga ea gidaghuudajeagaaschi, doodoonung'weakaaschi gwadeenyi sea suurja. Nea gwanda seawuutka neaweesa, ea doodoonung'weakaaschi meadajeega sean, ak geawundaanyi ea geatin haradam ea damanamughuush gil nea hawundaanyi bea jih ea geatin diktam ea muut gil. ",
