        },
        {
          "text": "Nea doodoonung'weakaaschi gwanda meatkweeda doodooda mida jarooda nea gidaghuudajeagaaschi gwanda miilayga, meatkweeni ea meatkweeda niirja ak gwanda gidingooji sis jea eeding'deawa.",
