          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoorajeagaaschi bea furiischoodiga, ea gidaghuudajeagaaschi, ea doodoonung'weakaaschi ak gwadeenyi sean sea suurja, nea gwaneaweesa meadajeega sean seawuutka, geawundaanyi geatin haradam ea damanamughuush gil, nea hawundeaba jih ea geatin diktam ea muut gil. ",
