          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gwanda ghooriida sea gidaghuuta nea gwaduukusa gidaghuudajeega mida dooshta, was heeda siihuuna haleanjeeda sisapa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba doodooda mida dooshta, abeeda gwanda measaji iyeenya meatkweeni ea measaji iyeenya meatkweeda niirja nea heechea eenuuksa haleanjeeda sisapa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda, ea haleanjeeda sisapa geadi aba riing'eeda. Ea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea giidiinyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak meatkweenagi bea jarooda mida gidingeayoojiga naweeda sigu dooshta, mida meatkweeda wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa. Abeeda gwanda measaji iyeenya eara meatkweeda niirja bea doodooda bea dooshta abeeda gwanda measaji iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Measajeega sean sigadiyeata silachiisa gheatkweaka haleanjeeda lukghumajeega abeeda ea sis. Measaji ang'wan gwanda doodoodeaba gah, nea measaji ang'wan gwanda doodooda mida jarooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak abeeda gicha gwanda measaji ang'wan bea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda, bea lagheanga sishit, geawundaanyi geatinagi gil ea gidagween iyeenya. Ak hawundeaba jih ea geatinagi gil ea gidagween iyeenya, nea geawundaanyi ea geatinagi gil, ak uhuudeaba measajeesu geayiin dabita sigadiyeata aba haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea jeedeaba doodoodida gwaneaweesa guhuunatka jea eaghastaawa, nea geawunyeeka nyaawa gooyang'da baneakta geatinda, ak banyeega geayiin uhuuda measa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.43"
            ]
          }
        }
