        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweanean ea ghwaahiinaan doodooda mida gah, abeeda gwanda ghooraji iyeenya mida doodooda mida gah, akaleala gwanda wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa bea dooshta, nea goofuursa wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara. Nea suurja gwanda wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara bea dooshta, nea goofuursa wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.44",
