          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ghooriida mida meatkweeda wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa gaba ashoohoodiga, gadiiyi aba heeda wagiida. Suh orjooga Sadoki gil bea jeeda orjooga Lawi ghapka heeda NG'UTAMIIDA gagadiiyeesa niny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
