        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goodeen doodoodida, geawundaanyi ea geatin bughala gil. Ak baraknataanyi bea jih ea geatin bughala gil ea neaweesiindaanyi, ak madeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA gwanda heeda wagiida. ",
