          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweanean ea ghwaahiinaan doodooda gheeda sibata ASEETA, ak goodeen ghuusiga doodoonung'weaka geatin muut meatkweeni ea geatin muut meatkweeda niirja nea baraknata dooshta ea geatin samwagu gil meatkweeni ea geatin samwagu meatkweeda niirja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
